        },
        {
          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Choose supervised learning if a target exists&quot;,
          &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Use classification or regression, and train the model against the known labels using algorithms like logistic regression, random forest, or gradient boosting.&quot;,
          &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;HowToStep&quot;,
          &quot;position&quot;: 2
        },
        {
          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Choose unsupervised learning if no target exists&quot;,
          &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Use clustering, dimensionality reduction, or anomaly detection to discover structure in unlabeled records.&quot;,
          &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;HowToStep&quot;,
          &quot;position&quot;: 3
        },
        {
          &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Consider semi-supervised learning for partially labeled data&quot;,
